    "intro_html":  "Shawarma is a spice cabinet and a hot surface, and it travels beautifully into a wrap. We marinate chicken breast in Greek yogurt loaded with cumin, coriander, smoked paprika and turmeric, sear it hard, and finish with a cool garlic yogurt sauce, sliced onion, tomato and a handful of pickles for the sharp bite that cuts the spice. Every burrito lands \u003cstrong\u003eunder 400 calories with 4 ounces of meat\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, on a high fiber tortilla that keeps you near 5 grams of net carb. We have Slow Cooker Chicken Shawarma Bowls on the site; this is the fast, seared, hand-held version with the garlic yogurt sauce instead of a bowl base.",
